# Everything the image build does not need. Two entries here are not just about
# size:
#   dashboard/dist — the ui stage builds it; copying a stale local one in would
#     silently ship whatever was last built on someone's laptop.
#   data/ — a developer's runtime directory (keys, subscriptions, history).
#     Baking it into a published image would leak secrets.
.git
.github
data
dashboard/dist
dashboard/node_modules
desktop/target
desktop/src-tauri/target
trust-proxy
trust-proxy-e2e
*.dmg
*.app
docs
